  "weekly_step_source": "CT-PLM-3: the step is the chart's rise from the first to the last loading week, spread evenly and rounded up to the load step (L-4), capped at these values (squat 5, bench 5, deadlift 7.5 kg a week). A fixed kg step would outrun the RPE target for a lighter lifter.",
